Cell["\<\
Optional exact verification of the final cancellation of auxiliary poles. The \
local comparisons are also available as \
qedFivePointMixedLocalChecks[qedMixedDerivation].\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5a91189e-d389-42dc-97f8-5df0a17d82fe"],

