Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Optional: More Information", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"530ac606-46ee-464b-8030-60930dcda6f4"],

Cell["\<\
Ask for individual sample values when you want to inspect a comparison. \
Physical and spurious checks share one table. Physical rows show residues; \
spurious rows show the leading divergent coefficient (zero when regular), \
pole order and finite limit. Values are visible directly, not hidden in \
list cells. Status is the overall pole result. The exact numbers are not \
rounded. The diagram and channel inputs do not change.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"31d0d817-0688-4a9c-84ee-4ad0b364bf60"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
