Cell["\<\
Other output choices are \"Summary\" for result counts and \"Details\" for \
the full diagnostic report. Add \"Samples\" -> 10 for more numerical checks. \
For another process, use the same three inputs: diagram amplitudes, \
factorization channels and the model containing the known lower-point \
amplitudes.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6689c81a-6bd1-4b51-9ee8-aed8150a897c"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
